Nep
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
DRAW 29 DEAL UTIOQ
UTIOQ 10 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
UTIOQ 9 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

PROGA 4 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE {PROGA, UTIOQ} PROGA
DESTSRC Suit match
DRAW
PILE ANY UTIOQ Size > 0
$win
AND
    OR
        PILE ALL PROGA Empty
        PILE ALL PROGA Empty
    OR
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
